 tray=new NotifyIcon{Icon=SuiteArt.AppIcon(),Text="Aura Wallpaper",Visible=true};var menu=new ContextMenuStrip();menu.Items.Add("Open studio",null,(s,e)=>{Show();WindowState=FormWindowState.Normal;Activate();});menu.Items.Add("Pause / resume",null,(s,e)=>{manualPause=!manualPause;pause.Text=manualPause?"Resume":"Pause";ApplyPolicy();});menu.Items.Add("Stop wallpaper",null,(s,e)=>Stop());menu.Items.Add("Exit",null,(s,e)=>{quitting=true;Close();});tray.ContextMenuStrip=menu;tray.DoubleClick+=(s,e)=>{Show();WindowState=FormWindowState.Normal;Activate();};policy.Interval=1000;policy.Tick+=(s,e)=>{ReloadExternalProfile();ApplyPolicy();};policy.Start();rotate.Interval=1000;rotate.Tick+=(s,e)=>Rotate();rotate.Start();SystemEvents.SessionSwitch+=SessionChanged;SystemEvents.DisplaySettingsChanged+=DisplaysChanged;FormClosing+=(s,e)=>{if(walls.Count>0&&!quitting){if(MessageBox.Show(this,"Exit Aura and stop live wallpapers? Use Minimize to tray to keep them running.","Exit Aura",MessageBoxButtons.YesNo)!=DialogResult.Yes){e.Cancel=true;return;}}Stop();Save();};FormClosed+=(s,e)=>{policy.Dispose();rotate.Dispose();SystemEvents.SessionSwitch-=SessionChanged;SystemEvents.DisplaySettingsChanged-=DisplaysChanged;tray.Visible=false;tray.Dispose();};Shown+=(s,e)=>{ApplyPolicy();if(toTray){Apply();if(walls.Count>0)Hide();}};
 }
 class Item{public string Source;public Item(string s){Source=s;}public override string ToString(){return WallpaperCatalog.Contains(Source)?"✦  "+Source:Path.GetFileName(Source);}}
 ListBox List(){return new ListBox{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,BackColor=panel,ForeColor=text,BorderStyle=BorderStyle.None,IntegralHeight=false,ItemHeight=30};}
 Button Button(string s){return new Button{Text=s,UseMnemonic=false,AutoSize=true,Height=34,BackColor=panel,ForeColor=text,FlatStyle=FlatStyle.Flat,FlatAppearance={BorderSize=0},Margin=new Padding(0,5,9,5),Padding=new Padding(10,3,10,3)};}
 ComboBox Combo(string[] items){var c=new ComboBox{DropDownStyle=ComboBoxStyle.DropDownList,Width=238,BackColor=panel,ForeColor=text};c.Items.AddRange(items);return c;}
 NumericUpDown Number(int min,int max,int value){return new NumericUpDown{Minimum=min,Maximum=max,Value=Math.Max(min,Math.Min(max,value)),Width=238,BackColor=panel,ForeColor=text};}
 CheckBox Check(string title,bool value){return new CheckBox{Text=title,Checked=value,AutoSize=true,Margin=new Padding(0,8,0,3)};}
 void AddSetting(FlowLayoutPanel p,string label,Control c){p.Controls.Add(new Label{Text=label,AutoSize=true,ForeColor=muted,Margin=new Padding(0,12,0,4)});p.Controls.Add(c);}
 Settings ReadSettings(){try{if(File.Exists(settingsPath)){var doc=new System.Xml.XmlReaderSettings{DtdProcessing=System.Xml.DtdProcessing.Prohibit,XmlResolver=null};using(var r=System.Xml.XmlReader.Create(settingsPath,doc)){var s=(Settings)new XmlSerializer(typeof(Settings)).Deserialize(r);s.Library=(s.Library??new List<string>()).Where(x=>!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(x)).Distinct().Take(2000).ToList();s.Playlist=(s.Playlist??new List<string>()).Where(x=>!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(x)).Take(2000).ToList();s.Fps=new[]{15,30,60}.Contains(s.Fps)?s.Fps:30;s.Density=Math.Max(20,Math.Min(200,s.Density));s.Speed=Math.Max(10,Math.Min(200,s.Speed));s.Volume=Math.Max(0,Math.Min(100,s.Volume));s.Minutes=Math.Max(1,Math.Min(120,s.Minutes));if(!new[]{"Fill","Fit","Stretch"}.Contains(s.Fit))s.Fit="Fill";if(!WallpaperCatalog.Contains(s.Selected)&&!File.Exists(s.Selected))s.Selected="Aurora";if(s.Monitor!="All monitors"&&!Screen.AllScreens.Any(x=>x.DeviceName==s.Monitor))s.Monitor="All monitors";return s;}}}catch{}return new Settings();}
 void Save(){try{Directory.CreateDirectory(Path.GetDirectoryName(settingsPath));string temp=settingsPath+".tmp";using(var stream=File.Create(temp))new XmlSerializer(typeof(Settings)).Serialize(stream,config);if(File.Exists(settingsPath))File.Replace(temp,settingsPath,null);else File.Move(temp,settingsPath);settingsWrite=File.GetLastWriteTimeUtc(settingsPath);}catch(Exception ex){state.Text="Settings could not be saved: "+ex.Message;}}
 void ReloadExternalProfile(){try{if(!File.Exists(settingsPath))return;var stamp=File.GetLastWriteTimeUtc(settingsPath);if(stamp==settingsWrite)return;Settings external;using(var reader=System.Xml.XmlReader.Create(settingsPath,new System.Xml.XmlReaderSettings{DtdProcessing=System.Xml.DtdProcessing.Prohibit,XmlResolver=null}))external=(Settings)new XmlSerializer(typeof(Settings)).Deserialize(reader);loading=true;config.Fps=new[]{15,30,60}.Contains(external.Fps)?external.Fps:30;config.Density=Math.Max(20,Math.Min(200,external.Density));config.Speed=Math.Max(10,Math.Min(200,external.Speed));config.Volume=Math.Max(0,Math.Min(100,external.Volume));config.PauseBattery=external.PauseBattery;config.PauseFullscreen=external.PauseFullscreen;fps.SelectedItem=config.Fps.ToString();density.Value=config.Density;speed.Value=config.Speed;volume.Value=config.Volume;battery.Checked=config.PauseBattery;fullscreen.Checked=config.PauseFullscreen;preview.UpdateOptions();foreach(var wall in walls)wall.Scene.UpdateOptions();settingsWrite=stamp;state.Text="Performance profile reloaded from Aster.";}catch(Exception ex){state.Text="Could not reload performance profile: "+ex.Message;}finally{loading=false;}}
 void SelectPreview(){if(library.SelectedItem==null)return;fault=null;config.Selected=((Item)library.SelectedItem).Source;details.Text=(WallpaperCatalog.Contains(config.Selected)?config.Selected:Path.GetFileName(config.Selected))+"\r\nPreview only · click Apply to change the desktop";preview.LoadSource(config.Selected);if(!loading)Save();ApplyPolicy();}
 void RefreshLibrary(){if(library==null)return;string selected=config.Selected,query=librarySearch.Text.Trim(),category=(string)libraryCategory.SelectedItem;bool wasLoading=loading;loading=true;library.BeginUpdate();try{library.Items.Clear();if(category!="Imported media")foreach(string name in WallpaperCatalog.Search(category,query))library.Items.Add(new Item(name));if(category=="Imported media")foreach(string path in config.Library.Where(File.Exists).Where(x=>Path.GetFileName(x).IndexOf(query,StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)>=0))library.Items.Add(new Item(path));int index=-1;for(int i=0;i<library.Items.Count;i++)if(((Item)library.Items[i]).Source==selected){index=i;break;}library.SelectedIndex=index>=0?index:library.Items.Count>0?0:-1;libraryCount.Text=library.Items.Count.ToString("N0")+" results";}finally{library.EndUpdate();loading=wasLoading;}}
 void Import(){using(var d=new OpenFileDialog{Title="Import local wallpaper",Multiselect=true,Filter="Images and video|*.jpg;*.jpeg;*.png;*.bmp;*.mp4;*.wmv;*.mov;*.m4v;*.avi"}){if(d.ShowDialog(this)!=DialogResult.OK)return;foreach(var file in d.FileNames){if(config.Library.Contains(file))continue;config.Library.Add(file);library.Items.Add(new Item(file));}librarySearch.Text="";config.Selected=d.FileNames.Last();libraryCategory.SelectedItem="Imported media";RefreshLibrary();SelectPreview();Save();}}
 void PopulatePlaylist(){playlist.Items.Clear();foreach(var s in config.Playlist)playlist.Items.Add(new Item(s));}
 void OptionsChanged(){if(loading)return;config.Fps=int.Parse((string)fps.SelectedItem);config.Density=(int)density.Value;config.Speed=(int)speed.Value;config.Volume=(int)volume.Value;config.Minutes=(int)minutes.Value;config.Fit=(string)fit.SelectedItem;config.Monitor=(string)monitors.SelectedItem;config.PauseBattery=battery.Checked;config.PauseFullscreen=fullscreen.Checked;config.Clock=clock.Checked;config.Shuffle=shuffle.Checked;preview.UpdateOptions();foreach(var wall in walls)wall.Scene.UpdateOptions();nextRotation=DateTime.Now.AddMinutes(config.Minutes);Save();ApplyPolicy();}
 internal Func<IntPtr> hostResolver=Desktop.Host;
 void Apply(){if(library.SelectedItem==null){state.Text="Choose a wallpaper from the library before applying it.";return;}string source=((Item)library.SelectedItem).Source;fault=null;var host=hostResolver();if(host==IntPtr.Zero){ShowFailure("Windows did not expose a compatible wallpaper host. Nothing was attached. Use Preview; retry after Explorer is available.");return;}Screen[] targets=config.Monitor=="All monitors"?Screen.AllScreens:Screen.AllScreens.Where(s=>s.DeviceName==config.Monitor).ToArray();if(targets.Length==0){ShowFailure("That monitor is disconnected. Choose an available monitor.");return;}var pending=new List<Wallpaper>();try{foreach(var screen in targets){var wall=new Wallpaper(config,source);wall.Scene.Failure=ShowFailure;wall.Scene.Muted=pending.Count>0;pending.Add(wall);wall.Scene.LoadSource(source);if(!wall.Scene.Ready)throw new Exception("Media could not be loaded.");if(!wall.Attach(host,screen.Bounds))throw new Exception(wall.AttachError??"Could not attach beneath desktop icons.");}foreach(var old in walls)old.Close();walls=pending;activeSource=source;config.Selected=source;manualPause=false;pause.Text="Pause";nextRotation=DateTime.Now.AddMinutes(config.Minutes);Save();ApplyPolicy();}catch(Exception ex){foreach(var w in pending)w.Close();ShowFailure(ex.Message);}}
 void Stop(){foreach(var w in walls.ToArray())w.Close();walls.Clear();activeSource=null;fault=null;manualPause=false;if(pause!=null)pause.Text="Pause";nextRotation=DateTime.MaxValue;if(state!=null)state.Text="Stopped · your normal Windows wallpaper is visible.";if(preview!=null&&!preview.IsDisposed)preview.SetPaused(!Visible||WindowState==FormWindowState.Minimized);}
 void ShowFailure(string message){if(IsDisposed)return;if(InvokeRequired){BeginInvoke(new Action<string>(ShowFailure),message);return;}fault=message;state.Text=message;details.Text=message;}
 void ApplyPolicy(){if(preview==null||preview.IsDisposed)return;string reason=fault!=null?"Playback error":manualPause?"Paused manually":locked?"Paused while Windows is locked":config.PauseBattery&&SystemInformation.PowerStatus.PowerLineStatus==PowerLineStatus.Offline?"Paused on battery":config.PauseFullscreen&&Desktop.Fullscreen()?"Paused for fullscreen app":null;foreach(var w in walls.ToArray()){if(!Desktop.IsWindow(w.Host)){Stop();ShowFailure("Explorer restarted. Choose Apply to reconnect wallpapers.");return;}w.Scene.SetPaused(reason!=null);}preview.SetPaused(manualPause||locked||!Visible||WindowState==FormWindowState.Minimized||walls.Count>0);if(fault!=null){state.Text=fault;return;}if(walls.Count==0)state.Text=manualPause?"Preview paused · select Resume to animate.":"Preview running · select Apply to desktop to activate this wallpaper.";if(walls.Count>0)state.Text=(reason??"Applied — show your desktop to view")+" · "+walls.Count+" monitor(s) · "+config.Fps+" FPS scene cap · "+(config.Playlist.Count>0?"playlist enabled":"single wallpaper")+"\r\nVideo frame rate follows the file; preview pauses while desktop playback is active.";}
 void Rotate(){if(walls.Count==0||manualPause||locked||DateTime.Now<nextRotation)return;if(config.PauseBattery&&SystemInformation.PowerStatus.PowerLineStatus==PowerLineStatus.Offline||config.PauseFullscreen&&Desktop.Fullscreen())return;var items=config.Playlist.Where(x=>WallpaperCatalog.Contains(x)||File.Exists(x)).ToList();nextRotation=DateTime.Now.AddMinutes(config.Minutes);if(items.Count==0)return;int idx=config.Shuffle?random.Next(items.Count):(items.IndexOf(activeSource)+1)%items.Count;activeSource=items[idx];foreach(var wall in walls)wall.Scene.LoadSource(activeSource);ApplyPolicy();}
 void SessionChanged(object sender,SessionSwitchEventArgs e){if(IsDisposed)return;BeginInvoke(new Action(()=>{locked=e.Reason==SessionSwitchReason.SessionLock?true:e.Reason==SessionSwitchReason.SessionUnlock?false:locked;ApplyPolicy();}));}
 void DisplaysChanged(object sender,EventArgs e){if(IsDisposed)return;BeginInvoke(new Action(()=>{Stop();monitors.Items.Clear();monitors.Items.Add("All monitors");foreach(var screen in Screen.AllScreens)monitors.Items.Add(screen.DeviceName);monitors.SelectedIndex=0;state.Text="Display configuration changed. Select your monitors and click Apply again.";}));}
 bool HasStartup(){try{using(var key=Registry.CurrentUser.OpenSubKey(@"Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run"))return key!=null&&key.GetValue("AsterAura")!=null;}catch{return false;}}
 void SetStartup(){if(loading)return;try{using(var key=Registry.CurrentUser.CreateSubKey(@"Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run")){if(startup.Checked)key.SetValue("AsterAura","\""+Application.ExecutablePath+"\" --tray");else key.DeleteValue("AsterAura",false);}}catch(Exception ex){ShowFailure("Startup setting failed: "+ex.Message);}}
}
